# The OpenMixer meta language packs: openmixer-langpack-<lang> requires the <lang> pack of every owner of codes
# (owners.txt), for each language omx-contract ships (languages.json). build.sh writes the subpackages between the
# markers with .github/actions/langpacks/langpacks.py before it builds; this file keeps the markers alone.
# Version-Release is the release of debian/changelog too: build.sh refuses a build where the two differ.
Name:           openmixer-langpacks
Version:        1
Release:        1%{?dist}
Summary:        OpenMixer meta language packs
License:        MIT
URL:            https://www.openmixer.org
BuildArch:      noarch

%description
The OpenMixer meta language packs, one per language: each pulls that language's catalog of every OpenMixer owner of
codes.

%prep

%build

%install

# BEGIN langpacks: generated by langpacks.py, do not edit
# END langpacks

%changelog
* Thu Nov 12 2026 Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com> - 1-1
- The meta language packs, one per shipped language (Open-Mixer/.github#37)
